performative-ui-svelte
======================

This project is a Svelte 5 port of performative-ui by vorpus:
https://github.com/vorpus/performativeUI

The original package is marked MIT licensed in its package metadata and README.
All component concepts, names, and visual design originate from that project.
This port re-implements those components in Svelte and adds a documentation site.

